<title>UK: Rentokil drops as NatWest downgrades.</title>
<headline>Rentokil drops as NatWest downgrades.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in business services group Rentokil Plc fell on Thursday as analysts at NatWest Securities lowered their rating on the stock to &quot;reduce&quot; from &quot;hold,&quot; traders said.</p>
<p>The stock was down 6p at 427 by 0956 GMT in moderate trade of 1.7 million shares.</p>
<p>Analysts at NatWest were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
